---
layout: default
title: Destiny Agent Grimoire
description: A searchable Destiny lore library and character personas that read from it.
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <h1>Destiny Agent Grimoire</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      The Grimoire is a searchable library of Destiny's books, dialogue and gear
      lore. Six characters read from it, and every shipped quote is checked against
      the library so you can look a line up before you use it. Everything stays
      on your computer.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="{{ '/grimoire/install/' | url }}">Get the Grimoire</a>
      <a class="button" href="{{ '/personas/' | url }}">Meet the characters</a>
    </div>

    <nav class="setup-order setup-order--hero" aria-label="Recommended setup order">
      <span class="setup-order-label">Setup order</span>
      <ol>
        <li><a href="{{ '/grimoire/install/' | url }}">1. Grimoire</a></li>
        <li><a href="{{ '/grimoire/mcp/' | url }}">2. AI access <span class="setup-optional">optional</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="{{ '/personas/install/' | url }}">3. Characters</a></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <aside class="transmission" id="tapes" data-rotator aria-label="Test exchanges from the character conversations">
    <p class="transmission-label">Test tapes</p>
    <div class="transmission-window">
      {% for voice in voices %}
      <div class="transmission-item{% if loop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" data-voice data-speaker="{{ voice.speaker | escape }}" data-topic="{{ voice.topic | escape }}">
        <p class="transmission-prompt">{{ voice.prompt | escape }}</p>
        <blockquote><p>{{ voice.text | escape }}</p></blockquote>
        <p class="transmission-caption">{% if voice.url %}<a href="{{ voice.url | url }}">{{ voice.speaker | escape }}</a>{% else %}<span class="transmission-speaker">{{ voice.speaker | escape }}</span>{% endif %} <span class="transmission-topic">/ {{ voice.topic | escape }}</span>{% if voice.captured %} <span class="transmission-captured">/ captured {{ voice.captured }}</span>{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="transmission-filters">
      <label class="transmission-filter">Character
        <select data-rotator-speaker>
          <option value="">All characters</option>
          {% for speaker in voices | uniqueSpeakers %}
          <option value="{{ speaker | escape }}">{{ speaker | escape }}</option>
          {% endfor %}
        </select>
      </label>
      <label class="transmission-filter">Topic
        <select data-rotator-topic>
          <option value="">All topics</option>
          {% for topic in voices | popularTopics %}
          <option value="{{ topic | escape }}">{{ topic | escape }}</option>
          {% endfor %}
        </select>
      </label>
    </div>
    <div class="transmission-controls" data-rotator-controls hidden>
      <button type="button" data-rotator-shuffle>Random</button>
      <button type="button" data-rotator-prev aria-label="Previous test transcript"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg></button>
      <button type="button" data-rotator-toggle>Pause</button>
      <button type="button" data-rotator-next aria-label="Next test transcript"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></button>
      <span class="transmission-count" data-rotator-count aria-hidden="true">1 / {{ voices.length }}</span>
    </div>
    <p class="transmission-note">{{ voices.length }} exchanges across {{ voices | uniqueSpeakers | length }} characters. Random picks from this set, not quotes from the games.</p>
  </aside>
</section>

<section class="categories" aria-label="Explore the project">
  <article class="category">
    <span class="category-index" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
    <div>
      <svg class="category-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-icon-placeholder="true">
        <path d="M4 5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 3H20v16H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 21.5z"/>
        <path d="M4 5.5v16"/>
      </svg>
      <h2>The Grimoire</h2>
      <p>
        One searchable library with {{ grimoire.counts.books | commas }} books,
        {{ grimoire.counts.transcripts | commas }} transcripts,
        {{ grimoire.counts.grimoire_cards | commas }} grimoire cards and
        {{ grimoire.counts.items | commas }} items. Search it yourself, or let an AI
        search it for you.
      </p>
      <div class="category-links">
        <a href="{{ '/grimoire/' | url }}">See what's inside</a>
        <a href="{{ '/grimoire/install/' | url }}">Install it</a>
        <a href="{{ '/grimoire/mcp/' | url }}">Connect an AI</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="category">
    <span class="category-index" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
    <div>
      <svg class="category-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-icon-placeholder="true">
        <circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.5"/>
        <path d="M5 20a7 7 0 0 1 14 0"/>
      </svg>
      <h2>The characters</h2>
      <p>
        The Drifter, Eris Morn, Zavala, Calus, Ghost and Mara Sov each have their own
        voice, memory and rules. They share the library and can quietly ask each
        other for help, without sharing private notes.
      </p>
      <div class="category-links">
        <a href="{{ '/personas/' | url }}">Meet them</a>
        <a href="{{ '/personas/drifter/' | url }}">The Drifter</a>
        <a href="{{ '/personas/eris/' | url }}">Eris Morn</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="category">
    <span class="category-index" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
    <div>
      <svg class="category-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-icon-placeholder="true">
        <path d="M9 3v6M15 3v6M6 9h12v3a6 6 0 0 1-12 0z"/>
        <path d="M12 18v3"/>
      </svg>
      <h2>Set up a character</h2>
      <p>
        Run one character on its own, or bring the whole crew into an AI app such
        as OpenCode or OpenClaw. They share the library; their private memories
        stay separate.
      </p>
      <div class="category-links">
        <a href="{{ '/personas/install/' | url }}">Install a character</a>
        <a href="{{ '/personas/platforms/' | url }}">Use another app</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="category">
    <span class="category-index" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
    <div>
      <svg class="category-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-icon-placeholder="true">
        <path d="M14.5 6.5a4 4 0 0 0-5 5L3 18l3 3 6.5-6.5a4 4 0 0 0 5-5l-2.5 2.5-2-2z"/>
      </svg>
      <h2>If something goes wrong</h2>
      <p>
        A missing library file, an AI connection that will not appear, a
        character that will not show up, or a quote that keeps failing. Start with
        the symptom and work back to the cause.
      </p>
      <div class="category-links">
        <a href="{{ '/troubleshooting/' | url }}">Fix a problem</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>
